# VITE_API_BASE=
#
# The Vue app calls the Laravel API on the same origin (`/api`) by default, so
# this file is normally not needed. Set it only if you host the UI and the API
# on different origins:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api.example.com/api
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) in the `frontend/` directory.
